&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://hcdtc.github.io/zh/docs/80-team-doc/1-doc-quickstart/2-hugo-quickstart/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Hugo 框架指引&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.jianshu.com/p/0b9aecff290c&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
