    &gt;Hugo Language and Syntax Support&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.gohugo.org/doc/overview/configuration/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
